I_8c\nYou Don't Know: https://youtu.be/A6E4GOAI2t4\n\nMore great 80s videos here: http://smarturl.it/Ultimate80?IQid=Be...\n\nFollow Berlin\nWebsite: http://www.berlinpage.com/band\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/berlinoffici...\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/RealTerriNunn\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/berlinband/\n\nSubscribe to Berlin on YouTube: http://smarturl.it/BerlinSub?IQid=Ber...\n\n---------\n\nLyrics:\n\nWatching every motion\nIn my foolish lover's game\nOn this endless ocean\nFinally lovers know no shame\n\nTurning and returning\nTo some secret place inside\nWatching in slow motion\nAs you turn around and say\n\nTake my breath away\nTake my breath away\n\nWatching I keep waiting\nStill anticipating love\nNever hesitating\nTo become the fated ones\nTurning and returning", "channel_id": "UCO2ijRnP_l0UbWvmpz-quQQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCO2ijRnP_l0UbWvmpz-quQQ", "duration": 251, "view_count": 665897020, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bx51eegLTY8", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["Berlinvevo", "vevo", "official", "music video", "video", "single", "album", "Top Gun", "Berlin", "Columbia", "Pop", "Take My Breath Away"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1788339068/ei/G4-XarvwKtDfobIP-Iya6AQ/ip/18.229.136.40/id/071e7579e80b4d8f/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/251.284/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3DBx51eegLTY8%26lang%3Den%26name%3Den%26ip%3D18.229.136.40%26ipbits%3D0%26expire%3D1788339068%26sparams%3Dip,ipbits,expire,caps,v%26signature%3D906028AF838F7B60DF03BE23BD852A56E8A4B93B.35FECB9FC38B866FBE56A4F8F08F24D55BCE052A%26key%3Ddg_yt0/rqh/4/hls_chunk_host/rr2---sn-bg0s7nlr.googlevideo.com/xpc/EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D/cps/1203/met/178